# Testing

- Use Vitest + Testing Library + jsdom
- Co-locate tests as `*.test.ts` or `*.test.tsx` next to the source
- Prefer testing pure logic and data mappers; keep component tests light
- After changing behavior: update tests and run `deno task test`
- Watch mode: `deno task test:watch`

## Example

See `@src/lib/utils.test.ts` for the expected Vitest style (`describe` / `it` /
`expect` imports from `vitest`).

## Do not

- Do not add Playwright or Storybook for MVP
- Do not use `deno test` for React/UI tests
